3">of </span><span begin="00:32.953" end="00:33.846">body </span><span begin="00:33.846" end="00:34.165">the </span><span begin="00:34.165" end="00:34.621">way </span><span begin="00:34.621" end="00:34.869">the </span><span begin="00:34.869" end="00:35.533">world </span><span begin="00:35.533" end="00:36.021">keeps </span><span begin="00:36.021" end="00:37.053">wishing</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.053" end="00:38.765"><span begin="00:37.053" end="00:37.550">Death </span><span begin="00:37.550" end="00:38.141">upon </span><span begin="00:38.141" end="00:38.765">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.850" end="00:43.482"><span begin="00:38.850" end="00:39.314">Take </span><span begin="00:39.314" end="00:39.803">it </span><span begin="00:39.803" end="00:41.659">away </span><span begin="00:41.659" end="00:42.291">feel </span><span begin="00:42.291" end="00:42.634">it </span><span begin="00:42.634" end="00:43.482">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.614" end="00:51.224"><span begin="00:46.614" end="00:47.078">Red </span><span begin="00:47.078" end="00:47.549">all </span><span begin="00:47.549" end="00:48.061">in </span><span begin="00:48.061" end="00:48.349">the </span><span begin="00:48.349" end="00:49.029">face </span><span begin="00:49.029" end="00:49.365">don't </span><span begin="00:49.365" end="00:49.797">calm </span><span begin="00:49.797" end="00:50.233">me </span><span begin="00:50.233" end="00:51.224">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.280" end="00:57.465"><span begin="00:53.280" end="00:53.479">Cause </span><span begin="00:53.479" end="00:53.843">every </span><span begin="00:53.843" end="00:54.194">time </span><span begin="00:54.194" end="00:54.427">the </span><span begin="00:54.427" end="00:54.810">sun </span><span begin="00:54.810" end="00:55.228">comes </span><span begin="00:55.228" end="00:57.465">up</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.465" end="01:00.585"><span begin="00:57.465" end="00:57.745">I </span><span begi