:27.546" end="01:28.008">adjust </span><span begin="01:28.496" end="01:29.128">wait</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.779" end="01:33.096"><span begin="01:29.779" end="01:29.979">It's </span><span begin="01:29.979" end="01:30.260">taking </span><span begin="01:30.260" end="01:30.451">a </span><span begin="01:30.451" end="01:30.768">minute </span><span begin="01:30.768" end="01:30.984">for </span><span begin="01:30.984" end="01:31.216">me </span><span begin="01:31.216" end="01:31.392">to </span><span begin="01:31.392" end="01:31.552">give </span><span begin="01:31.552" end="01:31.936">up </span><span begin="01:32.416" end="01:33.096">hey</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.674" end="01:36.754"><span begin="01:33.674" end="01:33.906">It's </span><span begin="01:33.906" end="01:34.082">been </span><span begin="01:34.082" end="01:34.498">easier </span><span begin="01:34.498" end="01:34.707">to </span><span begin="01:34.707" end="01:34.898">forget </span><span begin="01:34.898" end="01:35.098">and </span><span begin="01:35.098" end="01:35.298">shut </span><span begin="01:35.298" end="01:35.746">up </span><span begin="01:36.170" end="01:36.754">woah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.281" end="01:40.690"><span begin="01:37.281" end="01:37.498">All </span><span begin="01:37.498" end="01:37.689">that's </span><span begin="01:37.689" end="01:37.904">left </span><span begin="01:37.904" end="01:38.082">in </span><span begin="01:38.082" end="01:38.241">my </span><span begin="01:38.241" end="01:38.504">pocket's </span><span begin="01:38.504" end="01:38.714">a </span><span begin="01:38.714" end="01:38.938">couple </span><span begin="01:38.938" end="01:39.114">of </span><span begin="01:39.114" end="01:39.707">bucks </span><span begin="01:40.122" end="01:40.690">hey</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.898" end="01:42.754"><span begin="01:40.898" end="01:41.258">All </span><span begin="01:41.258" end="01:41.602">I </span><span begin="01:41.602" end="01:42.092"